  "body_html": "<p>Embrace the symbolic beauty of the Celtic Tree of Life with this versatile and cozy quilt set by Jeminise. Perfect for nature lovers, this custom-designed quilt set adds a touch of farmhouse and fantasy nature charm to any bedroom decor while providing lightweight warmth in the summer and cozy comfort during the winter months.</p>\n<h3>Key Features</h3>\n<ul>\n  <li>\n<strong>Personalized Design:</strong> Fully customizable background, framing color, and text saying squares to make it a truly unique gift with your own personal touch.</li>\n  <li>\n<strong>Soft &amp; Cozy Feel:</strong> Crafted from 100% soft polyester fabric with a high-quality silk floss filling for breathable, long-lasting comfort.</li>\n  <li>\n<strong>Versatile Use:</strong> Multi-functional design perfect as a bed quilt, cozy throw blanket, backyard picnic mat, or camping companion.</li>\n  <li>\n<strong>Available Sizes:</strong> Choose the perfect fit for your space from Throw (60x70 inches), Twin (68x86 inches), Full (80x90 inches), Queen (90x90 inches), and King (102x91 inches).</li>\n  <li>\n<strong>Optional Pillowcases:</strong> Complete your bedding set by choosing to add 2 or 4 matching pillowcases (20x30 inches).</li>\n  <li>\n<strong>Easy Care:</strong> Machine washable fabric designed to resist pilling, fading, and wrinkling, drying quickly for low-maintenance care.</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Product Specifications</h3>\n<table>\n  <tbody>\n    <tr>\n      <th>Brand</th>\n      <td>Jeminise</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <th>Product Type</th>\n      <td>Quilt Set</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <th>Material</th>\n      <td>Polyester</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <th>Fabric Type</th>\n      <td>Polyester</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <th>Style</th>\n      <td>Farmhouse</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <th>Theme</th>\n      <td>Tree of Life, Flowers</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <th>Pattern</th>\n      <td>Tree of Life, Yggdrasil</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <th>Included Components</th>\n      <td>1 Quilt + Pillowcases (Optional)</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <th>Customization</th>\n      <td>1 text input, background, and framing color</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <th>Care Instructions</th>\n      <td>Machine Wash</td>\n    </tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table>",
